{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Characteristic_Polynomials)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Characteristic Polynomials)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b5166380b2f27d633122cb1fcf941cb3b030aca3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(n)=\\dfrac{5+3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{5-3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n.\\]\" width=\"425\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d58143a8c02ad995b9d0e4469875bb676a21f3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1)-f(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />, expressed in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" />, equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be2d5fea253451690b483291965fb5ffeb56fec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{2}f(n)\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }f(n)\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2f(n)+1\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }f^2(n)\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"504\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b13772e45d2200e683670311ce15551db68ddc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}(f^2(n)-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"100\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/2571f50236205757b9fcc11b5db985ceadbc3316.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{5+3\\sqrt{5}}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"43\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46b0c4a82746fe401f0464a70f1d5fe9db1cb162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{5-3\\sqrt{5}}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"43\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/b/fcb965b3629b20999d106147453b22d4ee10ebda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x =\\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"43\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e28e985b86613da9c69bb4095f3b7015063fa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"43\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/1/d117ea8f7b9d33b879a7967d70645de39ee9b5b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = ax^n + by^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" />.  \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/c/aec18bfe71ab7834cf0be0fc125801421c5cf118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) - f(n-1) = ax^{n+1} + by^{n+1} - ax^{n-1} - by^{n-1} = ax^n \\left(x-\\frac{1}{x}\\right) + by^n \\left(y - \\frac{1}{y}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"681\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2cdf8a7b07c89b66c3ed923f0e634a50e549384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - \\frac{1}{x} = y - \\frac{1}{y} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"152\" height=\"42\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99db13f6374673fdf91cd5ee6c4d72518f9771a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) - f(n-1) = ax^n + by^n = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ f(n)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"366\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26fd9aa08a2bb20b3b7ecc0cf36335a15985c741.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/b/5fb03b15df0cc79046c7ade387db670a8df1b910.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, while pulling one copy of the exponential part outside:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf52db9dfac41b3fa2eee7c304702ef7ef0efea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) = \\dfrac{5+3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\cdot \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}\\cdot\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{5-3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\cdot \\frac{1 - \\sqrt{5}}{2}\\cdot\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"615\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb907301537f0ae20de6777cd689cf84c875de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) = \\dfrac{20+8\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{20-8\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"467\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/487f02684ff470e09420f7d27723d1f140e76709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n-1) = \\dfrac{5+3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\cdot \\frac{2}{1 + \\sqrt{5}}\\cdot\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{5-3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\cdot \\frac{2}{1 - \\sqrt{5}}\\cdot\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"615\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf831aee00f2c354a2e004ab34cc3511eef3482.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n-1) = \\dfrac{(5+3\\sqrt{5})(1 - \\sqrt{5})}{5(1 + \\sqrt{5})(1 - \\sqrt{5})}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{(5-3\\sqrt{5})(1 + \\sqrt{5})}{5(1 - \\sqrt{5})(1 + \\sqrt{5})}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"617\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db6f18cd15209b086dec9ee3d2a22e75cb52c55f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n-1) = \\dfrac{-10-2\\sqrt{5}}{5(-4)}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{-10 + 2\\sqrt{5}}{5(-4)}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"499\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54a6579eee8163dedaea15c6e630fa6fbf1ef12f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n-1) = \\dfrac{10+2\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{10 - 2\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"470\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><br />\nComputing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cff9ba0ed3056f79e8d9d4856645f2eae7d9b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) - f(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" /> gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa85853dc85fd19aa1ce57b5ee36067fc951b54a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) - f(n-1) = \\dfrac{10+6\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{10-6\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"560\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be50c662455f2c81e67e2ea79ed54948f65a3a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) - f(n-1) = \\dfrac{5+3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n+\\dfrac{5-3\\sqrt{5}}{10}\\left(\\dfrac{1-\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"542\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/5/115f7fdbab3c9e381e455972390ca8216be519a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) - f(n-1) = f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Characteristic_Polynomials.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Characteristic_Polynomials)\">Solution 3 (Characteristic Polynomials)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Characteristic Polynomials)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51edd2e6e0e41688ddbd8fd18d611c21c3abee62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 \\pm \\sqrt{5}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"43\" /> are roots of the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/76740cce82ebcb9066d07e5b9b7ea1a6c96a8a03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> follows the recurrence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/5654aa926316d07a98a445dec8142d18ef9ebe4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = f(n-1) + f(n-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"219\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/1/661a19e439547dd394a9401c4369f8c36218081b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n+1) = f(n) + f(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"219\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/44044f3262abc40f17fb27f5252fc210e7535f1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n + 1) - f(n-1) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ f(n)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"264\" height=\"32\" />. -nullptr07, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016213617\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.725 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 291/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2984/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7563/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.294      1 -total\n 63.33%    9.053      1 Template:AHSME_40p_box\n 34.87%    4.984      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12500:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016213617 and revision id 293121. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}